# Product identity fields

## Model
- `Product.Brand` — **Company name** (e.g. Nestlé). Used for search/sort/grouping.
- `Product.CompanyName` — **Product name** (e.g. Maggi 70g, Nescafé Classic). What customers see.
- `Product.Barcode` — optional scanner code (unique when set).
- `Product.Symbol` — auto-generated hidden key for cart/API. Never show as a user field.

## UX
- Create/Edit: Company name + Product name (separate lines). Do not ask users to put Nestlé inside Maggi’s product name.
- Cart / inventory search: `Search` matches Brand **or** product name — “Nestlé” returns Maggi + Nescafé, etc.
- Maggi 70g and Maggi 150g = two products; same Brand “Nestlé”, different barcodes/names.
